+# Taskboard CLI
+
+A dependency-free task manager for Bun. Its data file is `.taskboard.json` in the
+current directory, or the path in `TASKBOARD_FILE`.
+
+```sh
+bun run src/cli.ts add --title "Buy milk" --tags home,errands --due 2030-01-10
+bun run src/cli.ts list --status open --tag errands
+bun run src/cli.ts done 1
+bun run src/cli.ts stats
+bun run src/cli.ts delete 1
+```
+
+All commands write one JSON value to standard output. Invalid commands and data
+also exit non-zero and report a concise diagnostic on standard error. Writes use
+a temporary sibling file followed by rename, so a completed write never leaves a
+partially written database.
